            "text": "<h4><strong>Designers/Design Assistants</strong></h4><p>We are currently seeking goal-oriented designers/sales professionals with prior sales experience.</p><p>The ideal candidate for this position loves to help clients with their furniture, art, rug and accessory selections. He or she is fashion forward with a type A personality, exudes enthusiasm and is self-motivated. A professional appearance is required as daily interface with customers is to be expected. Top-quality customer service is part of the culture at Noël Home, so we value exceptional presentation, communication and customer service skills.</p><p>The applicant must be able to work 40 hours per week (5 days per week, including some weekends), and scheduling flexibility is a must.</p>"
